          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[mod(x,9)]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": ["Add the digits.", "If the sum is $9$ or more, take away nines."],
        "solution": "Add the digits and find the remainder by $9$: $[[mod(x,9)]]$.",
        "skill": "check-nines",
        "difficulty": 1,
        "compute": "x - 9*floor(x/9)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "x": {
              "from": 100,
              "to": 9999
            }
          },
          "where": ["x < 10000"]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sum",
        "prompt": "What is the nine-score of $[[a]] + [[b]]$? (Add the nine-scores of the two numbers.)",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[mod(a+b,9)]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": [
          "Find each number’s score from its digit sum.",
          "Add the scores and take away $9$ if needed."
        ],
        "solution": "Scores $[[mod(a,9)]]$ and $[[mod(b,9)]]$ add to $[[mod(a,9)+mod(b,9)]]$, which scores $[[mod(a+b,9)]]$.",
        "skill": "check-nines",
        "difficulty": 2,
        "compute": "mod(mod(a,9) + mod(b,9), 9)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "a": {
              "from": 100,
              "to": 199
            },
            "b": {
              "from": 100,
              "to": 199
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "product",
        "prompt": "What is the nine-score of $[[a]] \\times [[b]]$? (Multiply the nine-scores.)",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[mod(a*b,9)]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": [
          "Find each score from the digit sum.",
          "Multiply the scores, then find the score of that."
        ],
        "solution": "Scores $[[mod(a,9)]]$ and $[[mod(b,9)]]$ multiply to $[[mod(a,9)*mod(b,9)]]$, which scores $[[mod(a*b,9)]]$.",
        "skill": "check-nines",
        "difficulty": 2,
        "compute": "mod(mod(a,9) * mod(b,9), 9)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "a": {
              "from": 11,
              "to": 99
            },
            "b": {
              "from": 11,
              "to": 99
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "wrong",
        "prompt": "Tom says $[[a]] \\times [[b]] = [[a*b+9*k+1]]$. The nine-scores don’t match. What is the right answer?",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[a*b]]"],
          "form": "any",
          "mistakes": [
